riscos-risc3d (0.14-1) rol; urgency=medium

  * rol-3d 0.14: --replay writes PNG pictures, and ROL3D_REPLAY can
    change the recording as it is drawn (imm: glDrawElements from arrays
    done as glBegin/glEnd; nopush: glPush/PopClientAttrib done by rol-3d;
    clamp: GL_CLAMP as GL_CLAMP_TO_EDGE; sized: unsized texture formats
    as sized ones; noalpha: no alpha test; nomip; nohint), to find what
    the Pi's GPU driver draws wrongly in TORCS.

