riscos-risc3d (0.8-1) rol; urgency=medium

  * rol-3d 0.8: arrays and indices from a program's memory are given to
    Linux's Mesa as memory (it streams them into one buffer of its own),
    not each put in a fresh buffer object; OP_UPLOADS chooses (for
    comparing). The modules are unchanged (RISC3D 0.03, Linux3D 0.02).

